      "side": 1,
      "message": "`RtsUsbDevice` is not designed as a base class (non-virtual destructor), so please avoid marking internal helpers `protected:` solely for `TestableRtsUsbDevice` in `rts5817_usb_device_test.cc:451-456` (which also ends up calling them while `dfu_interface_ \u003d\u003d -1`, passing `wIndex \u003d 0xFFFF`).\n\nPrefer keeping `dfu_poll_idle()` and `dfu_clear_status()` `private:` (passing `dfu_interface` explicitly once `find_dfu_interface()` returns `DfuInterfaceInfo` by value) and exercising status polling / error clearing through the public `dfu_download()` API (or squashing this CL into https://crrev.com/c/8629987).",
